//! Read-only metadata generated by [`event`](crate::event) and [`emit!`](crate::emit).
//!
//! Event authors declare signals and fields through attributes. Processors inspect
//! the resulting descriptions; construction and index assignment are implementation
//! details, not a supported API for adapters or consumers.

